<h3 class=3D"md-header" id=3D"lesson-why-you-give-ai-a-business-map">Why yo=
u give AI a Business Map</h3>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph">A business map is one file plus a set of departme=
nt folders =E2=80=94 a model of how your whole business runs and how it mak=
es money (Leads =E2=86=92 Appointments =E2=86=92 Presentations =E2=86=92 Sa=
les). It's the single thing that turns AI from a <em>tool</em> into an <em>=
employee</em>.</p>
<aside class=3D"md-callout is-warning" role=3D"note" aria-label=3D"Warning"=
><span class=3D"md-callout-icon" aria-hidden=3D"true"><svg xmlns=3D"http://=
