dden=3D"true"><path d=3D"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 =
21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d=3D"M12 9v4"></path><path d=3D"M12 17=
h.01"></path></svg></span><div class=3D"md-callout-main"><div class=3D"md-c=
allout-body">
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>Without a map</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"md-list">
<li>Your AI doesn't know where anything lives or how you make money, so you=
 hand-hold every task. <strong>You stay the router</strong> =E2=80=94 every=
 request runs through you.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></aside>
