lass=3D"md-callout-body">
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>With a map (how it works)</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"md-list">
<li>A request comes in =E2=86=92 your AI reads the map, opens the right dep=
artment, pulls what it needs, and does the work =E2=80=94 the way an employ=
ee would. That's how it handles most of your requests <strong>without you i=
n the loop</strong>.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></aside>
